! v0.73.0 PCM test 1:  water in water (HF/STO-3G, C-PCM).
!
! Purpose:  smoke test of the full Stage 1 pipeline -- cavity
! discretization, charge solver, SCF coupling, energy.  Reference for
! the SCF total in vacuum on this geometry (test_v073_no_pcm_regression):
!   E_HF      = -74.963919012725 Ha
! and water/water solvation energy is expected on the order of
! ~ -10 kcal/mol = -0.0159 Ha at HF/STO-3G; experimental Delta_G_solv
! for water in water is -6.3 kcal/mol but a minimal-basis HF/CPCM
! number can easily disagree by several kcal/mol.  The point of this
! test is the SIGN of the polarization free energy (G_pol < 0) and
! the consistency of the diagnostics (sum(q) close to zero for a
! neutral solute, by Gauss's law).
%method  HF
%basis   sto-3g
%job     energy
%pcm     cpcm     ! v0.74+ default is iefpcm; v0.73 tests pin cpcm explicitly
%solvent water
%geom angstrom
O  0.000000   0.000000   0.119262
H  0.000000   0.755453  -0.477047
H  0.000000  -0.755453  -0.477047
*end
